loom penrace shared_pen_green=1 shared_pen_failed=3 per_process_pen_green=4 ships=4
file tools/fixtures/t/topology_routing_scan.sh five measuring legs and three checking ones, the shortcut checked where it is relied on
file tools/t/topology_routing_witness.rish every figure bound by name, tier cadence
file tools/fixtures/t/topology_routing_control.sh ten plants, each lifted, twenty behaviors
file external-research/20260906-195719_what-it-costs-to-decide-the-next-hop.md the paper, B+/87 at Field
file construction/REDS.md %510 booked and closed -- nine shared pens and a guard that kept its reason
file tools/fixtures/t/tlb_reach_census.sh both pens per-process; the same on eight more sites
file tools/t/tlb_reach_witness.rish the build's own words printed before the assert fires
scope one red closed on metal, and the decision cost of four topologies measured
status GREEN -- topology_routing witness and its twenty-behavior control, tlb_reach re-run green through the roster, reds monotone and spine green
recommend keep-going -- the next lap in this lane is the question this one raised and deferred: one shared table is beautiful while the graph is whole, and Comlink nodes leave. The measurable version is cheap with the instrument now standing -- remove one node, rebuild the table from the identity, and count how many of the 719 entries change. That number IS the update cost under churn, it decides whether a 270-byte shared table is usable at all, and the four shapes will not answer it alike.
